.TH REGOLITH-SESSION-COSMIC-LAUNCH 1
.SH NAME
regolith-session-cosmic-launch \- start the experimental Regolith COSMIC session
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B regolith-session-cosmic-launch
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B regolith-session-cosmic-launch
starts the experimental Regolith COSMIC Wayland session.  It prepares the
Regolith resource environment, launches Sway through the COSMIC session
manager, and preserves the generated Regolith Sway configuration.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cosmic-session (1),
.BR sway (1)
